sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor AO as Account officer
  participant UI as Portal UI (browser)
  participant API as Portal API
  participant DB as Database
  participant ST as Contract store (S3)
  participant EM as Email (SES / SMTP)
  participant GW as Outbound gateway
  participant BI as Billing API
  participant NW as Network API

  Note over AO,NW: Step 1 · Sign in
  AO->>UI: work email
  UI->>API: POST /api/auth/otp/request
  API->>DB: OtpChallenge (HMAC of code)
  API->>EM: 6-digit code
  AO->>UI: code
  UI->>API: POST /api/auth/otp/verify
  API->>DB: AoSession (SHA-256 of token)
  API-->>UI: Set-Cookie corpone_session

  Note over AO,NW: Step 2 · Company
  AO->>UI: UEN (leaves the field)
  UI->>API: GET /api/companies/{uen}
  API->>DB: blacklist, Company lookup
  API-->>UI: existing / customer, name, address
  UI->>API: POST /api/signups
  API->>DB: Company (if new), Signup DRAFT
  UI->>API: POST /api/signups/{id}/contract
  API->>ST: PutObject (SSE)

  Note over AO,NW: Step 3 · Account officer
  UI->>API: GET /api/merchants
  UI->>API: PUT /api/signups/{id}/account-officer
  API->>DB: NRIC/FIN, blacklist, merchant checks

  Note over AO,NW: Step 4 · Plan and lines
  UI->>API: GET /api/signups/{id}/categories
  UI->>API: PUT /api/signups/{id}/category
  opt upload SIMs
    UI->>API: POST /api/signups/{id}/sims
    API->>DB: Sims AVAILABLE, pair with Numbers, PAIRED, UploadBatch
  end
  UI->>API: GET /api/signups/{id}/availability
  UI->>API: POST /api/signups/{id}/cart
  API->>DB: CartLines, SIM + number RESERVED

  Note over AO,NW: Step 5 · Review and submit
  UI->>API: POST /api/signups/{id}/submit
  API->>DB: blacklist re-check, Company, AccountOfficer, CorporateAccount, Lines, ASSIGNED
  API-->>UI: account number

  Note over AO,NW: Step 6 · Provisioning (background task)
  API->>GW: create billing account
  GW->>BI: POST (Idempotency-Key account-id)
  loop each line
    API->>GW: activate line
    GW->>NW: POST (Idempotency-Key line-id-network)
    API->>GW: add subscription
    GW->>BI: POST (Idempotency-Key line-id-billing)
  end
  API->>EM: eSIM QR codes to the verified AO email
  API->>DB: Signup COMPLETED / PARTIALLY_FAILED / FAILED
  loop until finished
    UI->>API: GET /api/accounts/{account number}
  end
